RP23 compact and divisible e-cash

The implementations in ecash/rp23 are adapted from TI-OfflineEcash by
Alfredo Rial and Ania M. Piotrowska, under Apache License 2.0.
https://github.com/aniampio/TI-OfflineEcash
Commit: 638ac24662b32da4b86124b742392650e57521e1
The adaptation uses blstrs group arithmetic, wire codecs, role adapters,
batch verification and shared state. The upstream license is retained in
ecash/rp23/LICENSE.

LCB24 circuit and Schnorr modules

ecash/lcb24/fetch_sources.py retrieves four modules from private-billing
and checks their pinned SHA-256 hashes before compilation.
https://github.com/kev-liao/private-billing
